rience a pure battle of wits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;How Many Secrets Under Ceiling&quot; is a deduction game that revolutionizes traditional mystery-solving by eliminating the need for physical evidence. Solving complex cases solely through logical reasoning within the text, exploiting contradictions and loopholes in conversation, and scrutinizing details and questions in narrative. This scenario is written by a new writer with Gentosha Mystery Fiction Award, based on<i> <strong>The Walker on the Ceiling</strong></i> by <strong>Edogawa Ranpo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmask lies, reveal truths, and become the sole master of this linguistic labyrinth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you don't need to play the role of anyone else; simply be your authentic self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll make choices based on your own logic, preferences, and even your personal values, solving puzzle after puzzle, navigating danger after danger, and having your every thought validated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Honkaku Mystery is written in the style of a light novel, making you always smile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lively dialogue and banter save you from all the unhappiness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Personality Options, be your unique self!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933960/extras/fdd96218e3ea7c9c76a513a11e189b98.poster.avif?t=1773814588\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933960/extras/fdd96218e3ea7c9c76a513a11e189b98.webm?t=1773814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\